OL,3,ADozens arrested in Paris as day of
OL,4,Aprotests begins across France
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands are expected at
OL,7,Fprotests across France today against
OL,8,Frising fuel prices and the cost of
OL,9,Fliving
OL,11,FA major demonstration is scheduled in
OL,12,FParis for 14:00 local time (13:00 BST);
OL,13,Fdozens have already been arrested in
OL,14,Fthe capital, and tear gas has been
OL,15,Freported in various cities
OL,17,FProtesters are hyped up and we're
OL,18,Fhearing constant chants calling for
OL,19,FPresident Macron to resign, writes our
OL,20,Fcorrespondent in Paris
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
